window.bookSummaryJSON = "<b>The <i>New York Times</i> bestselling Beautiful series—from the authors of <i>Love and Other Words </i>and <i>The Unhoneymooners</i>—continues as Will Sumner and Hanna Bergstrom (from <i>Beautiful Player</i>) find that a wedding and everlasting love were just the beginning.</b><br><br>One player tamed. One nerd girl satisfied. One more major life decision to make.<br> <br>When Will fell for Hanna, her quirky sense of humor and fierce dedication to her career were part of the attraction. But when the job offers start rolling in for her—and oh, they do—Hanna has trouble deciding what she wants, where they should live, and how much she should burden Will with the decision. Magic between the sheets is only one part of a relationship...getting on the same page is quite another altogether."; 
